---
import SlideLayout from '../../../layouts/SlideLayout.astro';
---
<SlideLayout
  title="Slide 13 - Mity i częste błędy"
  bgImage="/images/background-4.jpg"
  bgOverlay="linear-gradient(rgba(10,14,23,0.78), rgba(10,14,23,0.9))"
>
  <div class="content">
    <div class="header">
      <h1 class="title">
        Mity i <span class="highlight">częste błędy</span>
      </h1>
    </div>

    <div class="compare">
      <article class="col myths">
        <header>
          <div class="badge"><i class="ti ti-ghost-2"></i> Mity</div>
        </header>

        <div class="row myth">
          <div class="myth-icon"><i class="ti ti-pencil-off"></i></div>
          <div>
            <h3><span class="strike">Jedna obowiązkowa notacja</span></h3>
            <p>
              Model jest <strong>niezależny od notacji</strong>.<br> Liczy się
              spójność, tytuł, opisane elementy i relacje.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="row myth">
          <div class="myth-icon"><i class="ti ti-file-description"></i></div>
          <div>
            <h3><span class="strike">C4 pokazuje decyzje architektoniczne</span></h3>
            <p>
              Pokazuje <strong>wynik decyzji</strong> (aktualny kształt systemu).<br>
              Same decyzje powinny być w <strong>ADR-ach</strong>.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="row myth">
          <div class="myth-icon"><i class="ti ti-circles-relation"></i></div>
          <div>
            <h3><span class="strike">C4 tylko do monolitów</span></h3>
            <p>
              Działa równie dobrze dla <strong>mikroserwisów</strong> i systemów
              rozproszonych.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="col mistakes">
        <header>
          <div class="badge warn"><i class="ti ti-alert-triangle"></i> Błędy</div>
        </header>

        <div class="row mistake">
          <div class="mistake-icon"><i class="ti ti-stack-2"></i></div>
          <div>
            <h3>Mieszanie poziomów abstrakcji</h3>
            <p>
              Na jednym diagramie baza danych, aplikacja webowa i klasa repozytorium; odbiorca nie wie, na jakiej skali czyta diagram
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="row mistake">
          <div class="mistake-icon"><i class="ti ti-box-multiple"></i></div>
          <div>
            <h3>Zbyt wiele elementów</h3>
            <p>
              Zbyt wiele elementów na jednym diagramie. Zamiast dzielić na podwidoki lub schodzić na niższy poziom, wszystko trafia na jeden rysunek
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="row mistake">
          <div class="mistake-icon"><i class="ti ti-box-multiple"></i></div>
          <div>
            <h3>Brak opisów na elementach i relacjach</h3>
            <p>
              Prostokąty bez nazw typów, strzałki bez informacji co komunikują i w jaki sposób.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</SlideLayout>

<style is:global>
  .stage {
    justify-content: flex-start;
  }

  .content {
    max-width: 1640px;
    padding: 60px 3rem 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 36px;
    opacity: 0;
    animation: fadeUp 0.8s ease-out 0.15s forwards;
  }

  .level-chip {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 7px 18px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.1);
    border: 1px solid rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.35);
    color: var(--cyan-400);
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .level-chip i { font-size: 18px; }

  .title {
    font-size: 64px;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -1px;
    line-height: 1.05;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .title .highlight {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--cyan-400), var(--cyan-600));
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
  }

  .compare {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 32px;
    width: 100%;
    align-items: stretch;
  }

  .col {
    background: rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.55);
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.15);
    border-radius: 22px;
    padding: 28px 32px 32px;
    text-align: left;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 18px;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(28px);
    animation: fadeUp 0.85s ease-out forwards;
  }

  .col.myths { animation-delay: 0.45s; }
  .col.mistakes {
    animation-delay: 0.6s;
    border-color: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.35);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.08);
  }

  .col header {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
    padding-bottom: 16px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.18);
  }

  .badge {
    align-self: flex-start;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 6px 16px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    background: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.12);
    color: #e2e8f0;
    border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.3);
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .badge i { font-size: 18px; }

  .badge.warn {
    background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.14);
    color: #fcd34d;
    border-color: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.45);
  }

  .col h2 {
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #cbd5e1;
    margin: 0;
    letter-spacing: -0.2px;
  }

  .row {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .strike {
    text-decoration: line-through;
    text-decoration-color: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.55);
    text-decoration-thickness: 2px;
  }

  .row.myth,
  .row.mistake {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 56px 1fr;
    gap: 18px;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .myth-icon,
  .mistake-icon {
    width: 56px;
    height: 56px;
    border-radius: 14px;
    background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.3);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .myth-icon {
    background: rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.12);
    border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.3);
  }

  .mistake-icon i {
    font-size: 28px;
    color: #fbbf24;
  }

  .myth-icon i {
    font-size: 28px;
    color: #cbd5e1;
  }

  .row.myth h3,
  .row.mistake h3 {
    margin: 0 0 6px;
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #f1f5f9;
    letter-spacing: -0.2px;
  }

  .row.myth p,
  .row.mistake p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 300;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: #cbd5e1;
  }

  .row.myth p strong,
  .row.mistake p strong {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #f1f5f9;
  }

  .hint {
    margin-top: auto;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 14px 18px;
    background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.08);
    border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.3);
    border-radius: 14px;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: #fef3c7;
    line-height: 1.35;
  }

  .hint i {
    font-size: 22px;
    color: #fbbf24;
    flex: 0 0 auto;
  }

  .hint strong {
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #fcd34d;
  }
</style>
